{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25792072\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究STN-DBS与上肢冻结的神经肌肉及皮层活动特征，提供冻结相关低频振荡和刺激抵抗机制的证据，尽管不能直接等同于FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25803045\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"比较FOG与姿势不稳的StartReact反应，提供脑干运动程序异常及FOG特异性机制的证据，有助于区分冻结与其他轴性运动障碍。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25807463\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接测量不同刺激频率下的STN神经同步变化，为解释低频与高频STN-DBS对FOG及步态产生不同作用提供神经生理机制依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25810510\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"动物实验显示不同位置的PPN刺激可产生冻结或改善步态，提供脑干 locomotor 网络及刺激靶点位置影响FOG的竞争性机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25827041\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述可穿戴传感器对FOG的客观识别、预测及DBS术后评估，有助于分析不同研究中FOG表型定义和测量方法造成的结果差异。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25833008\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接报告STN-DBS由高频转换为60 Hz后FOG及步态改善的临床病例证据，是分析刺激频率与FOG关系及其异质性的重要资料。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25852532\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"题目仅涉及一般运动过程的计算建模，缺乏STN、帕金森病或FOG相关信息，无法确定其对研究问题有实质贡献。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25856485\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论一般运动模块及康复理论，仅笼统涉及帕金森病，没有FOG或STN神经活动的具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25876458\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论纹状体胆碱能中间神经元的解剖、生理及奖赏功能，没有涉及FOG、步态或STN相关运动机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25894561\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然综述帕金森病步态和姿势稳定性的可穿戴传感器评估，但没有FOG特异性机制或STN相关证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25907754\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"讨论PPN的定位及其在运动和步行控制中的作用，可作为STN之外脑干步行控制网络的理论背景，帮助评估替代性运动机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25909898\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究帕金森病患者居家与临床运动表现的相关性，但没有FOG特异性分析、DBS干预或STN神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25925761\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述STN与GPi-DBS的临床效果，并专门讨论轴性症状、术后步态问题及刺激参数调整，可提供FOG相关临床疗效和刺激策略背景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25926466\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"在帕金森病动物模型中直接记录步行时STN局部场电位及其与运动、认知网络的同步活动，为解释STN振荡的频段和行为状态依赖性提供机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25972835\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"针对FOG的运动切换和运动适应缺陷机制进行评论，可提供区别于STN异常同步的竞争性运动控制机制解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25976516\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较FOG与非FOG患者的视觉运动适应，检验感觉运动适应和运动记忆机制与FOG的关系，为评估非STN特异性竞争机制提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:25981958\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论基底节奖赏导向行为及尾状核控制的眼动和物体操作，未涉及STN、帕金森病FOG或步行自动控制的具体机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26018593\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"FOG专题综述涵盖药物及手术治疗策略，可补充FOG临床治疗反应和手术干预效果的背景证据，辅助解释临床疗效异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26030664\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究健康猴子PPN神经元在眼动任务中的节律性放电，与帕金森病步行、FOG或STN活动没有直接联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26037016\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述DBS引起的步态恶化、低频刺激、PPN替代靶点及自适应刺激策略，可帮助分析STN刺激参数与轴性症状及FOG之间的临床和机制联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26038610\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究视觉提示联合跑台训练对帕金森病步态的康复效果，没有STN活动、DBS或FOG机制方面的实质证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26047732\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论帕金森病患者多指和多肌肉协同稳定性及其神经控制，没有涉及FOG或STN特异性神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26050074\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然直接研究FOG患者的提示训练及跌倒管理，但属于康复干预研究，没有STN、DBS或神经活动机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26102020\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述帕金森病运动自动化障碍，明确涵盖FOG及纹状体感觉运动网络异常，可提供与STN振荡机制相竞争或互补的自动化控制解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26108960\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"随机比较STN与GPi-DBS对姿势扰动后代偿性迈步的影响，提供靶点特异性轴性运动效应证据，并有助于区分FOG与姿势不稳相关步态障碍。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e82424a8-1b71-4578-a5bc-65e1b3b5d4f8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T152227720847Z", "elapsed_seconds": 180.907, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T15:25:28.633876+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "816fcbcf835c11d47517c18823a60f5cd4eabce2712f18c26e269515c5a63d36", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T152227720847Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e15a2761ecc0177070b3bfdcc2ede2e762e8be11bde97255eaf69ae24b07e940"}}}
